# ClassBuild — API Keys
# In the app, keys are entered on the Setup page. The CLI scripts read them from environment variables.
# This file documents what you'll need.

# Required — Anthropic Claude API key
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional — Google Gemini API key, used as a course-content provider (alternative to Claude)
# and by `npm run smoke:gemini` and `scripts/canvas-course.ts --provider gemini`.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
